                name: "Head to the house mentioned by the girl",
                desc: "Henrik, the owner of the Hypnos' House, is a brooding and aloof man.\nPersuaded by a spirited young girl, he reluctantly offers you shelter for the night.\nTime to head to the house mentioned by the girl.",
